Conflicts: debian-mate-default-settings, mint-mate-default-settings, ubuntu-mate-default-settings
Replaces: debian-mate-default-settings, mint-mate-default-settings, ubuntu-mate-default-settings
Description: Spaced Linux default settings for the MATE desktop
 Supplies the MATE defaults capability required by mate-session-manager.
 The actual desktop, panel, Compiz, theme, icon, and application defaults
 are maintained by Spaced Linux.
